 king on f2\n- The bishop on c5 is extremely active and controls key central squares\n- It maintains flexibility for my other pieces\n- It creates immediate tactical threats that White must address\n- In the opening, developing pieces while creating threats is ideal, especially when the opponent has compromised their king safety\n\nAnswer: B: f8-c5"}
