n capturing material.\n\nReason: The White Rook on b1 is trapped and undefended. By playing Q: e1-b1, I can capture it directly, winning significant material (a full Rook is worth about 5 points). This is a forcing move that immediately improves my position materially. The Rook on b1 has already moved (RWF1) and has no escape squares - it's a free piece.\n\nAnswer: Q: e1-b1"}
