e bishop with d7-e6 wins material immediately and severely weakens White\'s position. With White\'s king exposed on e5 and the bishop removed, I\'ll have much better attacking chances. This is a straightforward tactical win that puts me in a significantly better position.\n\nAnswer: P: d7-e6'}
