 advanced passed pawn), improves my bishop's position to an active central square, and maintains my material advantage. With my superior pieces (Rook, Bishop, Knight vs just pawns), I should easily convert this into a win once the promotion threat is removed.\n\nAnswer: B: c8-e6"}
