uge material advantage, the fastest win is to create unstoppable passed pawns. The move b7-b5 advances my queenside majority and creates immediate threats. White's king on h2 cannot prevent the queenside pawns from advancing. After b5, I threaten to play b5-b4-b3-b2-b1=Q, and White has no way to stop both the a and b pawns while also dealing with my other pawns.\n\nAnswer: P: b7-b5"}
